{"hw":"ἀνεξέταστος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀνεξέταστος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀνεξ-έταστος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">not searched out, not inquired into</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">examined,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.36</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">21.218</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.22</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">without inquiry</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">investigation,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ὁ ἀ. βίος οὐ βιωτός ἀνθρώπῳ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">38a</span> </span>. <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-τως</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.550</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.94d</span> </span>, etc.</div></div>"}